6. Alternative Concept and Complexity Analysis
Object Creation Method	Explanation	Valid Object Guarantee
Overloaded constructors	Initializes objects with different parameters.	Strong, if validation is included.
Default constructor + setters	Creates object first and assigns values later.	Weak, object may contain invalid values temporarily.
Static factory method	Creates and returns an initialized object.	Strong, validation can be performed before returning.

Time and Space Complexity:

For creating n ParkingTicket objects:
Method	Time Complexity	Space Complexity
Constructors	O(n)	O(n)
Setters	O(n)	O(n)
Static factory	O(n)	O(n)

All three approaches require O(n) time and O(n) heap space for n ticket objects, assuming constant-time initialization.
